# Wave W17-AC (Route 229): loop sand — loop-lane sand, offshore flecks: a green-pale sand scattered thin where the lane loops wide into open sea, the island’s south water footing (design: Palmside sails north, the long coast road south — the lane between them holds its breath; spec-presence thinnest in the program, the R40 precedent, recorded in the plan). Route 229’s own sand — split from its twin Route 230’s palm sand by warmth entire (offshore cool-green vs palm-shore warm) and from Route 220’s long sand by hue: green-offshore here, blue-cool there.
